{"api_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/28908","collected_at":"2026-09-27T21:56:34.290486+00:00","comments":[],"issue":{"active_lock_reason":null,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"### Description\n\nI'm running into the same issue from https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/24982, which was closed prematurely by the reporter (as he found a workaround [avoiding using `jax.numpy.linalg.inv`], which was not enough in my case, but this is still a serious issue).\n\nTo reproduce:\n\nFirst (won't segfault yet), run:\n```\nIn [1]: import jax\n   ...: import pickle\n   ...: from jax.experimental.serialize_executable import serialize, deserialize_and_load\n\nIn [2]: @jax.jit\n   ...: def inverse(M):\n   ...:     return jax.numpy.linalg.inv(M)\n   ...:\n\nIn [3]: traced = jax.jit(inverse).trace(M=jax.numpy.eye(3))\n   ...: lowered = traced.lower()\n   ...: compiled = lowered.compile()\nWARNING:2025-05-21 15:33:37,920:jax._src.xla_bridge:791: An NVIDIA GPU may be present on this machine, but a CUDA-enabled jaxlib is not installed. Falling back to cpu.\nIn [4]: M = jax.numpy.eye(3)\n   ...: M_inv = compiled(M=M)\n\nIn [5]: binary, in_pytree, out_pytree = serialize(compiled)\n\nIn [6]: with open(\"binary.jax\", \"wb\") as f:\n   ...:     f.write(binary)\n   ...: with open(\"in_pytree.pkl\", \"wb\") as f:\n   ...:     f.write(pickle.dumps(in_pytree))\n   ...: with open(\"out_pytree.pkl\", \"wb\") as f:\n   ...:     f.write(pickle.dumps(out_pytree))\n   ...:\n\nIn [7]: quit()\n```\nThen (will segfault), run:\n```\nIn [1]: import jax\n   ...: import pickle\n   ...: from jax.experimental.serialize_executable import serialize, deserialize_and_load\n\nIn [2]: with open(\"binary.jax\", \"rb\") as f:\n   ...:     loaded_binary = f.read()\n   ...: with open(\"in_pytree.pkl\", \"rb\") as f:\n   ...:     loaded_in_pytree = pickle.load(f)\n   ...: with open(\"out_pytree.pkl\", \"rb\") as f:\n   ...:     loaded_out_pytree = pickle.load(f)\n   ...:\n\nIn [3]: loaded_compiled = deserialize_and_load(loaded_binary, loaded_in_pytree, loaded_out_pytree)\nWARNING:2025-05-21 15:34:57,077:jax._src.xla_bridge:791: An NVIDIA GPU may be present on this machine, but a CUDA-enabled jaxlib is not installed. Falling back to cpu.\n\nIn [4]: M = jax.numpy.eye(3)\n\nIn [5]: M_inv = loaded_compiled(M=M)\nSegmentation fault (core dumped)\n```\n\n### System info (python version, jaxlib version, accelerator, etc.)\n\n```\nIn [1]: import jax; jax.print_environment_info()\nWARNING:2025-05-21 15:38:26,725:jax._src.xla_bridge:791: An NVIDIA GPU may be present on this machine, but a CUDA-enabled jaxlib is not installed. Falling back to cpu.\njax:    0.6.1\njaxlib: 0.6.1\nnumpy:  2.2.6\npython: 3.11.9 (main, Apr  6 2024, 17:59:24) [GCC 11.4.0]\ndevice info: cpu-1, 1 local devices\"\nprocess_count: 1\nplatform: uname_result(system='Linux', release='5.19.0-45-generic', [...], machine='x86_64')\n```","closed_at":null,"closed_by":null,"comments":0,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/28908/comments","created_at":"2025-05-21T22:40:43Z","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/28908/events","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/28908","id":3081572683,"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"total_blocking":0},"issue_field_values":[],"labels":[{"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null,"color":"d73a4a","default":true,"description":"Something isn't working","id":1104782284,"name":"bug","node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMTA0NzgyMjg0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/labels/bug"}],"labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/28908/labels{/name}","locked":false,"milestone":null,"node_id":"I_kwDOCTkjjc63rRFL","number":28908,"performed_via_github_app":null,"pinned_comment":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax